column2:
[May] Qāssa-ṭābat, the sweeper of Er[eškigal,] accept this;
166	may he welcome my friend and [walk at] h[is side!]
167	May my friend not [ ... ]; may his heart not sicken!

[May] Ninšuluhha, the housekeeper of the house, accept this;
173	may she welcome my friend and walk at his side;
173a	[may she ... ] before my friend!
